ng to its fast locals and cells, so a write is seen by the"] [263 1 "// frame's code at its next load (the loop's and the compiled code's loads read f.Fast and f.Cells, never a copy:"] [264 1 "// survey \"Design: 219\"); a name none of the code's goes to the frame's extra locals."] [267 1 "// FrameLocalsProxyType is the proxy's type (\"FrameLocalsProxy\", registered as a Mapping by _collections_abc)."] [272 1 "// frameSlot is one of a code's names in co_localsplusnames' order: the fast locals (a parameter that is a cell read"] [273 1 "// through its cell), then the cells that are no parameter, then the free variables."] [276 18 "// the index in f.Fast or f.Cells, -1 for the other"] [277 18 "// an earlier slot has the name (each)"] [313 1 "// slotValue is s's value in f, nil when unbound."] [342 1 "// slotOf is framelocalsproxy_getkeyindex: the slot of key's name, an exact str by its text, else any key by its hash"] [343 1 "// and ==; read: only a bound one. -1 when none."] [395 1 "// set is framelocalsproxy_setitem (v nil: del): a local's slot written, never removed; else the extra locals."] [427 1 "// each calls fn on the bound names and their values in order, then the extra locals'. A name twice among the slots"] [428 1 "// (an inlined comprehension's own name in a fast slot beside the function's cell of that name, while the comprehension"] [429 1 "// runs: GH-128396's case, one slot in CPython holding the plain value) gives its first bound slot's value."] [455 1 "// dict is the proxy's items as a new dict (PyDict_Update(dict, proxy))."] [467 1 "// merge is framelocalsproxy_merge: other a dict or a proxy, each of its keys set; false for another mapping."] [567 2 "// nb_or: either operand the proxy, the result a dict of the left's items, then the right's"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[12 23] [59 25] [83 14] [83 24] [135 42] [150 28] [220 23] [223 25] [224 19] [224 29] [243 23] [244 25] [351 24] [361 22] [383 21] [384 26] [434 25] [436 14] [436 